#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:1
msgid "Release 0.14 (2010-02-04)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:3
msgid "This release has the following improvements:"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:5
msgid ""
"The garbage collector now starts deleting garbage much faster than before. "
"It no longer determines liveness of all paths in the store, but does so on "
"demand."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:9
msgid ""
"Added a new operation, `nix-store --query                 --roots`, that "
"shows the garbage collector roots that directly or indirectly point to the "
"given store paths."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:13
msgid ""
"Removed support for converting Berkeley DB-based Nix databases to the new "
"schema."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:16
msgid ""
"Removed the `--use-atime` and `--max-atime` garbage collector options. They "
"were not very useful in practice."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:19
msgid "On Windows, Nix now requires Cygwin 1.7.x."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-0.14.md:21
msgid "A few bug fixes."
msgstr ""
